      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Labrador_Nature_Reserve"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Labrador Park was once called Pasir Panjang Beach, Malay for “Long Beach,” before land reclamation reshaped the shoreline.",
